  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1555\">\n<p data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1555\"><strong data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1488\">Normal</strong>: All latency values are within normal limits, no conduction block.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1650\">\n<p data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1650\"><strong data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1585\">Prolonged N13 or N20</strong>: Suggests <strong data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1649\">central or peripheral sensory pathway dysfunction</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1734\">\n<p data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1734\"><strong data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1671\">Absent waves</strong>: May indicate severe sensory nerve or spinal cord involvement.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1886\">\n<p data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1886\">Helps in evaluating <strong data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1779\">multiple sclerosis</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1804\">cervical myelopathy</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1832\">traumatic nerve injury</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1852\">B12 deficiency</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1885\">spinal cord compression</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
